{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2021-06", "window": 3, "start_date": 1623801600, "end_date": 1624406399, "month_true_total": 336, "quota": 7, "returned": 7, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 21:55:18 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "94185906", "author": {"steamid": "76561198038594435", "personaname": "DiscoChris", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198038594435/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 3509, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3093, "last_played": 1689016918, "avatar": "04a20d32a20e024e0b906c6f84f98baa79fcf14f"}, "language": "english", "review": "This one got a bad press at launch, but I love it - been a nice steady challenge and a good buy once discounted.", "timestamp_created": 1624395181, "timestamp_updated": 1624395181, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "94182485", "author": {"steamid": "76561198201040141", "personaname": "B-29", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198201040141/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1780, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1630, "last_played": 1633512476, "avatar": "c3965e8aab27c89183c0445b8539ab9b4135853e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Much better now than at release", "timestamp_created": 1624390489, "timestamp_updated": 1624390489, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "94176433", "author": {"steamid": "76561198146974538", "personaname": "Wolve", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/wolve033/", "num_games_owned": 320, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 12821, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5834, "last_played": 1745262666, "avatar": "e49df9e19ca580ebd13d8d6b69c43a6c9bad8ac0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Picked this up after friends kept recommending the Mass Effect Trilogy. I figured that I could start with the smaller game to get acquainted with the ME universe and see if I'd enjoy it ... and boy was in for a surprise! Story line is straight-forward enough and the characters are interesting. But the atmosphere and combat is quite enjoyable!\n\nCan definitely recommend this game! Once this is done, I will hit the Remastered trilogy!\n\nEdit (after playing ME Trilogy) ... oh boy! I now see why the old fans didn't like Andromeda. The characters in the ME Trilogy are much more professional (except for the Citadel DLC, which feels like it was taken out of a Marvel comic / movie) and Shepard is such an awesome character. But comparing Andromeda to the Shepard saga is not really justified. Taken as a separate title in itself, Andromeda is still an enjoyable game with good combat, more movement and generally larger game worlds (this is also made possible by the technology which was available for MEA but not for the original trilogy). The music is good too, but I see a lot of story elements taken from the original trilogy.", "timestamp_created": 1624382554, "timestamp_updated": 1718615817, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "94168044", "author": {"steamid": "76561198133209695", "personaname": "Sriracha Lasagna", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/060899123457/", "num_games_owned": 335, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 2582, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 133, "last_played": 1781423888, "avatar": "752eb38c3b0bc6f74708ec2c3d44d00bda41edde"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fine", "timestamp_created": 1624372069, "timestamp_updated": 1624372069, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "94148518", "author": {"steamid": "76561198089627129", "personaname": "FrobaFett", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198089627129/", "num_games_owned": 257, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 4672, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 424, "last_played": 1755634667, "avatar": "500a3a34628164563d1eb9c8b14a5ad6effedb09"}, "language": "english", "review": "A vastly underrated addition to the Mass Effect series. Not as good as the original trilogy but still a solid inclusion and absolutely worth checking and deciding for yourself if it's good.", "timestamp_created": 1624338288, "timestamp_updated": 1624338288, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "94143383", "author": {"steamid": "76561198094373628", "personaname": "Str8 Boolin", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198094373628/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 44, "playtime_forever": 2196, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 791, "last_played": 1782869460, "avatar": "1931ed1e83d59974eff7b49db95ff0e7ab32a0bb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Andromeda is a shallow, repetitive, unfinished mess, lacking any semblance of what made the original trilogy great. \n\nThe story and characters are dull and uninteresting, and the combat, though it does have some interesting ideas, is held back by some baffling design decisions and boring encounters bogged down by the game's open world structure. The gameplay is essentially Mass Effect 3 if you could jump, had no control over your squad mates, and every combat arena was an open field. \n\nWorth it only on a steep sale or if you just can't get enough of the Mass Effect universe. The game had potential, but it is wholly unrealized.", "timestamp_created": 1624328355, "timestamp_updated": 1624328355, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.4761618971824646", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "94134164", "author": {"steamid": "76561198364606363", "personaname": "hammerofthegods", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198364606363/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 221, "playtime_forever": 1621, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 115, "last_played": 1783542640, "avatar": "cdc8943127fdf184ba3ffebda8522df74c48f844"}, "language": "english", "review": "The Mortal Kombat Annihilation of the Mass Effect series.", "timestamp_created": 1624310758, "timestamp_updated": 1624828335, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written